#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:319
#: 5d6b0625f9ac4bbcb4169c0cc7f657cf
msgid "The GroundSteering output function acts much like the rudder output function except that it only acts when the aircraft is below :ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` altitude. At altitudes above :ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` the output will be the trim value for the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:324
#: 6bd65af05e9845509da43ef590a41a05
msgid "See the separate page on :ref:`setting up ground steering <tuning-ground-steering-for-a-plane>`"
