#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:331
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:441
#: 9d044fa49d914b349cc2dbf80dd663c3
#: edf8818182a742b1a72aeaf6f8192159
msgid "This output is for throttle control of an auxiliary :ref:`booster-motor` to add an additional vertical thrust source in Multi-Copter and QuadPlane applications."
